DECLARE `s 386AL act` IS ONE OF
    `s 386AL(1)(a) inform the company that the director is a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(1)(b) inform the company that the director has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(1A)(a) inform the company that the director is a nominee on the date of incorporation and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee on that date`
    `s 386AL(1A)(b) inform the company that the director has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(2)(b) inform the company that the director has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(3)(a) inform the company that the director ceases to be a nominee`
    `s 386AL(3)(b) inform the company of a change to the particulars provided to the company`
    `s 386AL(4)(a) inform the foreign company that the director is a nominee on the date of registration and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee on that date`
    `s 386AL(4)(b) inform the foreign company that the director has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(5)(a) inform the foreign company that the director is a nominee on the appointed day and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(5)(b) inform the foreign company that the director has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the director is a nominee`
    `s 386AL(5A)(a) inform the foreign company that the director ceases to be a nominee`
    `s 386AL(5A)(b) inform the foreign company of a change to the particulars provided to the foreign company`

§ `Section 386ALA: the register of nominee shareholders`

-- src:26535 | 386ALA.—(1) A company or foreign company must keep a
-- src:26536 | register of its shareholders who are nominees (called in this Part
-- src:26537 | the register of nominee shareholders) in the prescribed form and at the
-- src:26538 | prescribed place.
@ref s 386ALA(1) (src:26535-26538)
GIVEN `the body has kept a register of its shareholders who are nominees in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(1) the company or foreign company has kept the register of nominee shareholders as required` MEANS
    IF `the body has kept a register of its shareholders who are nominees in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question): "must keep a register of its shareholders who are nominees ... in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place"; no time is fixed, so a register not kept on the date asked is the failure (as for s 386AF(7))

-- src:26535 | 386ALA.—(1) A company or foreign company must keep a
-- src:26536 | register of its shareholders who are nominees (called in this Part
-- src:26537 | the register of nominee shareholders) in the prescribed form and at the
-- src:26538 | prescribed place.
@ref s 386ALA(1) (src:26535-26538)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALA act`
`s 386ALA(1) a company or foreign company must keep a register of nominee shareholders` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386ALA(1) keep a register of its shareholders who are nominees in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    -- no LEST: s 386ALA(1) gives this duty no deadline in days (assumed, not ruled; see notes/lest-without-deadline.md)

-- src:26540 | (2) A company or foreign company must, within 7 days after the
-- src:26541 | company or foreign company is informed of any fact and provided
-- src:26542 | with any particulars mentioned in section 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3),
-- src:26543 | (3A) or (4), enter that fact and those particulars in its register of
-- src:26544 | nominee shareholders.
@ref s 386ALA(2) (src:26540-26544)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company has entered the fact and the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the company or foreign company entered the fact and the particulars` IS A DATE
      `the day the company or foreign company was informed of the fact and provided with the particulars` IS A DATE
      `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(2) the company or foreign company has entered the fact and the particulars in time` MEANS
    `s 386AF(8) timing: the act was done in time` `the company or foreign company has entered the fact and the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders` `the day the company or foreign company entered the fact and the particulars` `the day the company or foreign company was informed of the fact and provided with the particulars` 7 `the date asked`   -- FALSE-kind where late ("within 7 days after the company or foreign company is informed": ruling (a)); NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording) while the 7 days have not run out

-- src:26540 | (2) A company or foreign company must, within 7 days after the
-- src:26541 | company or foreign company is informed of any fact and provided
-- src:26542 | with any particulars mentioned in section 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3),
-- src:26543 | (3A) or (4), enter that fact and those particulars in its register of
-- src:26544 | nominee shareholders.
@ref s 386ALA(2) (src:26540-26544)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALA act`
`s 386ALA(2) a company or foreign company must enter the fact and the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders within 7 days after it is informed` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386ALA(2) enter the fact and the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders`
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company did not enter the fact and the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders within 7 days after it was informed (s 386ALA(2), (6))"

-- src:26548 | (3) A company or foreign company must, within 7 days after the
-- src:26549 | company or foreign company is informed under
-- src:26550 | section 386ALB(5)(a) that a shareholder of the company or foreign
-- src:26551 | company has ceased to be a nominee, enter the following in its
-- src:26552 | register of nominee shareholders:
-- src:26554 | (a) the fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee;
-- src:26556 | (b) the date on which the shareholder ceased to be a nominee.
@ref s 386ALA(3) (src:26548-26556)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company has entered the fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee and the date on which the shareholder ceased to be a nominee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the company or foreign company entered them` IS A DATE
      `the day the company or foreign company was informed that a shareholder has ceased to be a nominee` IS A DATE
      `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(3) the company or foreign company has entered the cessation in time` MEANS
    `s 386AF(8) timing: the act was done in time` `the company or foreign company has entered the fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee and the date on which the shareholder ceased to be a nominee` `the day the company or foreign company entered them` `the day the company or foreign company was informed that a shareholder has ceased to be a nominee` 7 `the date asked`   -- FALSE-kind where late ("within 7 days after the company or foreign company is informed under section 386ALB(5)(a)": ruling (a)); NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording) while the 7 days have not run out

-- src:26548 | (3) A company or foreign company must, within 7 days after the
-- src:26549 | company or foreign company is informed under
-- src:26550 | section 386ALB(5)(a) that a shareholder of the company or foreign
-- src:26551 | company has ceased to be a nominee, enter the following in its
-- src:26552 | register of nominee shareholders:
-- src:26554 | (a) the fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee;
-- src:26556 | (b) the date on which the shareholder ceased to be a nominee.
@ref s 386ALA(3) (src:26548-26556)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALA act`
`s 386ALA(3) a company or foreign company must enter the cessation of a shareholder as a nominee within 7 days after it is informed` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386ALA(3) enter the fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee and the date on which the shareholder ceased to be a nominee`
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company did not enter the cessation of the shareholder as a nominee within 7 days after it was informed (s 386ALA(3), (6))"

-- src:26558 | (4) A company or foreign company must, within 7 days after the
-- src:26559 | company or foreign company is informed under
-- src:26560 | section 386ALB(5)(b) of any change to the particulars of a person
-- src:26561 | for whom a shareholder of the company or foreign company is a
-- src:26562 | nominee, enter the following in its register of nominee shareholders:
-- src:26564 | (a) the new particulars of that person;
-- src:26566 | (b) the date on which the particulars of that person changed.
@ref s 386ALA(4) (src:26558-26566)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company has entered the new particulars of the person for whom a shareholder is a nominee and the date on which they changed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the day the company or foreign company entered them` IS A DATE
      `the day the company or foreign company was informed of the change to the particulars` IS A DATE
      `the date asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(4) the company or foreign company has entered the change in time` MEANS
    `s 386AF(8) timing: the act was done in time` `the company or foreign company has entered the new particulars of the person for whom a shareholder is a nominee and the date on which they changed` `the day the company or foreign company entered them` `the day the company or foreign company was informed of the change to the particulars` 7 `the date asked`   -- FALSE-kind where late ("within 7 days after the company or foreign company is informed under section 386ALB(5)(b)": ruling (a)); NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording) while the 7 days have not run out

-- src:26558 | (4) A company or foreign company must, within 7 days after the
-- src:26559 | company or foreign company is informed under
-- src:26560 | section 386ALB(5)(b) of any change to the particulars of a person
-- src:26561 | for whom a shareholder of the company or foreign company is a
-- src:26562 | nominee, enter the following in its register of nominee shareholders:
-- src:26564 | (a) the new particulars of that person;
-- src:26566 | (b) the date on which the particulars of that person changed.
@ref s 386ALA(4) (src:26558-26566)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALA act`
`s 386ALA(4) a company or foreign company must enter the new particulars within 7 days after it is informed of a change` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    MUST `s 386ALA(4) enter the new particulars of the person for whom a shareholder is a nominee and the date on which they changed`
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company did not enter the new particulars within 7 days after it was informed of the change (s 386ALA(4), (6))"

-- src:26571 | (5) Subject to section 386AM, a company or foreign company must
-- src:26572 | not disclose, or make available for inspection, the register of nominee
-- src:26573 | shareholders or any particulars contained in the register of nominee
-- src:26574 | shareholders to any member of the public.
@ref s 386ALA(5) (src:26571-26574)
GIVEN `the person is a member of the public` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the disclosure is made in compliance with a requirement made, or in the exercise of a power conferred, under section 386AM` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(5) the company or foreign company is barred from disclosing the register of nominee shareholders to the person` MEANS
    IF `the disclosure is made in compliance with a requirement made, or in the exercise of a power conferred, under section 386AM`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subject to section 386AM, a company or foreign company must not disclose ..." read as: where the disclosure is under s 386AM the bar does not apply
    ELSE (IF `the person is a member of the public`
          THEN JUST TRUE
          ELSE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is on disclosure "to any member of the public"; a person who is not one is outside the limit

-- src:26571 | (5) Subject to section 386AM, a company or foreign company must
-- src:26572 | not disclose, or make available for inspection, the register of nominee
-- src:26573 | shareholders or any particulars contained in the register of nominee
-- src:26574 | shareholders to any member of the public.
@ref s 386ALA(5) (src:26571-26574)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALA act`
`s 386ALA(5) a company or foreign company must not disclose the register of nominee shareholders to a member of the public` MEANS
    PARTY `the company or foreign company`
    SHANT `s 386ALA(5) disclose the register of nominee shareholders or any particulars in it, or make it available for inspection, to a member of the public`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the company or foreign company` BECAUSE "the company disclosed the register of nominee shareholders or its particulars, or made it available for inspection, to a member of the public (s 386ALA(5), (6))"

DECLARE `s 386ALA act` IS ONE OF
    `s 386ALA(1) keep a register of its shareholders who are nominees in the prescribed form and at the prescribed place`
    `s 386ALA(2) enter the fact and the particulars in its register of nominee shareholders`
    `s 386ALA(3) enter the fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee and the date on which the shareholder ceased to be a nominee`
    `s 386ALA(4) enter the new particulars of the person for whom a shareholder is a nominee and the date on which they changed`
    `s 386ALA(5) disclose the register of nominee shareholders or any particulars in it, or make it available for inspection, to a member of the public`

-- src:26576 | (6) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:26577 | subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5), the company or foreign
-- src:26578 | company, and every officer of the company or foreign company
-- src:26579 | who is in default, shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be
-- src:26580 | liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386ALA(6) (src:26576-26580)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(6) the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i)): "shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000"

-- src:26576 | (6) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:26577 | subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5), the company or foreign
-- src:26578 | company, and every officer of the company or foreign company
-- src:26579 | who is in default, shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be
-- src:26580 | liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386ALA(6) (src:26576-26580)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALA(6) the officer of the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)` AND `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i)): "and every officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, shall each be guilty of an offence"

-- src:26576 | (6) If a company or foreign company fails to comply with
-- src:26577 | subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5), the company or foreign
-- src:26578 | company, and every officer of the company or foreign company
-- src:26579 | who is in default, shall each be guilty of an offence and shall each be
-- src:26580 | liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386ALA(6) (src:26576-26580)
GIVEN `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the company or foreign company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 386ALA(6) the most the company or foreign company or an officer in default may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF (IF `the person is the company or foreign company`
        THEN `s 386ALA(6) the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
        ELSE `s 386ALA(6) the officer of the company or foreign company is guilty of the offence` `the company or foreign company fails to comply with subsection (1), (2), (3), (4) or (5)` `the person is an officer of the company or foreign company who is in default, as section 408(3) gives that meaning` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 25000, 0, FALSE, FALSE)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for the person it makes guilty

§ `Section 386ALB: nominee shareholders`

-- "4 October 2022" (s 386ALB(1), (2), (3), (4)).
`s 386ALB(1) the day 4 October 2022` MEANS Date 4 10 2022

-- (1): a company incorporated on or after 4 October 2022 but before the appointed day.
-- src:26588 | 386ALB.—(1) A shareholder of a company incorporated on or
-- src:26589 | after 4 October 2022 but before the appointed day —
-- src:26591 | (a) who is a nominee on the date of incorporation must inform
-- src:26592 | the company of that fact, and provide to the company
-- src:26593 | prescribed particulars of the person for whom the
-- src:26594 | shareholder is a nominee, within 30 days after the date
-- src:26595 | of incorporation; or
-- src:26597 | (b) who becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation
-- src:26598 | must inform the company of that fact, and provide to the
-- src:26599 | company prescribed particulars of the person for whom the
-- src:26600 | shareholder is a nominee, within 30 days after the date on
-- src:26601 | which the shareholder becomes a nominee.
@ref s 386ALB(1) (src:26588-26601)
GIVEN `the date the company was incorporated` IS A DATE
      `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` IS A DATE
      `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 386ALB(1) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company` MEANS
    IF    `the date the company was incorporated` AT LEAST `s 386ALB(1) the day 4 October 2022`
       AND `the date the company was incorporated` LESS THAN `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)`
    THEN (IF `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation`
          THEN JUST (`period: the last day of a period after` `the date the company was incorporated` 30 Days)
          ELSE (IF `the shareholder becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation` AND `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` GREATER THAN `the date the company was incorporated`
                THEN JUST (`period: the last day of a period after` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` 30 Days)
                ELSE NOTHING))   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraphs (a) and (b)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (1) speaks of "A shareholder of a company incorporated on or after 4 October 2022 but before the appointed day"

-- (1A): a company incorporated on or after the appointed day.
-- src:26605 | (1A) A shareholder of a company incorporated on or after the
-- src:26606 | appointed day —
-- src:26608 | (a) who is a nominee on the date of incorporation must inform
-- src:26609 | the company of that fact, and provide to the company
-- src:26610 | prescribed particulars of the person for whom the
-- src:26611 | shareholder is a nominee, on that date; or
-- src:26613 | (b) who becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation
-- src:26614 | must inform the company of that fact, and provide to the
-- src:26615 | company prescribed particulars of the person for whom the
-- src:26620 | shareholder is a nominee, within 30 days after the date on
-- src:26621 | which the shareholder becomes a nominee.
