      `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` IS A DATE
      `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` IS A DATE
