`s 386ALB(1A) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company` MEANS
    IF `the date the company was incorporated` AT LEAST `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)`
    THEN (IF `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation`
          THEN JUST `the date the company was incorporated`   -- paragraph (a): "and provide to the company prescribed particulars ... on that date"
          ELSE (IF `the shareholder becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation` AND `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` GREATER THAN `the date the company was incorporated`
                THEN JUST (`period: the last day of a period after` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` 30 Days)
                ELSE NOTHING))   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraphs (a) and (b)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (1A) speaks of "A shareholder of a company incorporated on or after the appointed day"

-- (2): a company incorporated before 4 October 2022; paragraph (a) is deleted.
