          THEN JUST (`period: the last day of a period after` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` 30 Days)
          ELSE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): paragraph (b) speaks of a shareholder "who becomes a nominee after 4 October 2022"; paragraph (a) is deleted
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (2) speaks of "A shareholder of a company incorporated before 4 October 2022"

