-- (5): any company or foreign company: cessation, and change to the particulars, each within 30 days after.
-- src:26688 | (5) A shareholder of a company or foreign company (whether
-- src:26689 | incorporated or registered before, on or after the appointed day)
-- src:26690 | must —
-- src:26692 | (a) within 30 days after the shareholder ceases to be a
-- src:26693 | nominee, inform the company or foreign company of the
-- src:26694 | fact that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee; and
-- src:26696 | (b) within 30 days after any change to the particulars provided
-- src:26697 | to the company or foreign company under this section
-- src:26698 | (whether as in force on or before the appointed day) inform
-- src:26699 | the company or foreign company of the change.
@ref s 386ALB(5) (src:26688-26699)
GIVEN `the date the shareholder ceased to be a nominee, or the date the particulars provided changed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 386ALB(5) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company or foreign company` MEANS
    JUST (`period: the last day of a period after` `the date the shareholder ceased to be a nominee, or the date the particulars provided changed` 30 Days)

DECLARE `s 386ALB kind of body` IS ONE OF
    `s 386ALB a company`
    `s 386ALB a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11`

GIVEN kind IS A `s 386ALB kind of body`
      `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` IS A DATE
      `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` IS A DATE
      `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 386ALB(1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A) and (4) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company or foreign company` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `s 386ALB a company` THEN
        CONSIDER `s 386ALB(1) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`
        WHEN JUST d THEN JUST d
        WHEN NOTHING THEN
            CONSIDER `s 386ALB(1A) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`
            WHEN JUST d THEN JUST d
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `s 386ALB(2) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the company` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`
    WHEN `s 386ALB a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11` THEN
        CONSIDER `s 386ALB(3) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the foreign company` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`
        WHEN JUST d THEN JUST d
        WHEN NOTHING THEN
            CONSIDER `s 386ALB(3A) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the foreign company` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` `the shareholder was a nominee on the date of incorporation or registration` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`
            WHEN JUST d THEN JUST d
            WHEN NOTHING THEN `s 386ALB(4) the last day by which the shareholder must have informed the foreign company` `the date the company was incorporated or the foreign company was registered` `the shareholder becomes a nominee after that date` `the date the shareholder becomes a nominee`

-- (6): the offence of the shareholder.
-- src:26703 | (6) If a shareholder of a company or foreign company (as the case
-- src:26704 | may be) fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4)
-- src:26705 | or (5), the shareholder shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable
-- src:26706 | on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386ALB(6) (src:26703-26706)
GIVEN `the shareholder fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4) or (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALB(6) the shareholder is guilty of the offence` MEANS
    IF `the shareholder fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4) or (5)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the provision's own question; split site (i)): "If a shareholder of a company or foreign company (as the case may be) fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4) or (5), the shareholder shall be guilty of an offence"

-- src:26703 | (6) If a shareholder of a company or foreign company (as the case
-- src:26704 | may be) fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4)
-- src:26705 | or (5), the shareholder shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable
-- src:26706 | on conviction to a fine not exceeding $25,000.
@ref s 386ALB(6) (src:26703-26706)
GIVEN `the shareholder fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4) or (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE Penalty
`s 386ALB(6) the most the shareholder may be sentenced to on conviction` MEANS
    IF `s 386ALB(6) the shareholder is guilty of the offence` `the shareholder fails to comply with subsection (1), (1A), (2), (3), (3A), (4) or (5)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
    THEN JUST (Penalty OF 25000, 0, FALSE, FALSE)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the subsection states a penalty only for the person it makes guilty

-- (7): a shareholder is a nominee: "satisfies either or both of the following" (a) votes as directed, (b) receives dividends on behalf of another. A failed "if"-style test, marginal reading (a).
-- src:26710 | (7) In this section and section 386ALA, a shareholder of a company
-- src:26711 | or foreign company is a nominee if the shareholder satisfies either or
-- src:26712 | both of the following:
-- src:26714 | (a) the shareholder is accustomed or under an obligation
-- src:26715 | whether formal or informal to vote, in respect of shares in
-- src:26716 | the company or foreign company of which the shareholder
-- src:26717 | is the registered holder, in accordance with the directions,
-- src:26718 | instructions or wishes of any other person;
-- src:26723 | (b) the shareholder receives dividends, in respect of shares in
-- src:26724 | the company or foreign company of which the shareholder
-- src:26725 | is the registered holder, on behalf of any other person.
@ref s 386ALB(7) (src:26710-26725)
GIVEN `the shareholder is accustomed or under an obligation, whether formal or informal, to vote, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder receives dividends, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, on behalf of any other person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALB(7) the shareholder is a nominee` MEANS
    IF    `the shareholder is accustomed or under an obligation, whether formal or informal, to vote, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of any other person`
       OR `the shareholder receives dividends, in respect of shares of which the shareholder is the registered holder, on behalf of any other person`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (a failed "if", marginal reading (a)): "a shareholder ... is a nominee if the shareholder satisfies either or both of the following"

-- (7A): a shareholder who is a nominee under the new wording but was not under the old is treated as becoming a nominee on the appointed day.
-- src:26729 | (7A) In this section, a shareholder of a company incorporated
-- src:26730 | before the appointed day or of a foreign company registered under
-- src:26731 | Division 2 of Part 11 before that day, who, on that day —
-- src:26733 | (a) was not a nominee within the meaning of subsection (7) as
-- src:26734 | in force immediately before that day; but
-- src:26736 | (b) is a nominee within the meaning of that subsection as in
-- src:26737 | force on that day,
-- src:26739 | is treated as a shareholder of the company or foreign company who
-- src:26740 | becomes a nominee on the appointed day.
@ref s 386ALB(7A) (src:26729-26740)
GIVEN `the shareholder is of a company incorporated before the appointed day, or of a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11 before that day` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder was not, on the appointed day, a nominee within subsection (7) as in force immediately before that day` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shareholder is, on the appointed day, a nominee within subsection (7) as in force on that day` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`s 386ALB(7A) the day on which the shareholder is treated as becoming a nominee` MEANS
    IF    `the shareholder is of a company incorporated before the appointed day, or of a foreign company registered under Division 2 of Part 11 before that day`
       AND `the shareholder was not, on the appointed day, a nominee within subsection (7) as in force immediately before that day`
       AND `the shareholder is, on the appointed day, a nominee within subsection (7) as in force on that day`
    THEN JUST `the appointed day under section 386ALB(8)`
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (7A) treats as becoming a nominee on the appointed day only a shareholder who, on that day, "was not a nominee ... as in force immediately before that day" but "is a nominee ... as in force on that day"

-- (8): the definitions.
-- src:26744 | (8) In this section and section 386ALA —
-- src:26746 | “appointed day” means the date of commencement of section 10
-- src:26747 | of the Companies and Limited Liability Partnerships
-- src:26748 | (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2024;
@ref s 386ALB(8) (src:26744-26748)
GIVEN `the date section 10 of the Companies and Limited Liability Partnerships (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2024 commenced` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 386ALB(8) "appointed day" the appointed day` MEANS `the date section 10 of the Companies and Limited Liability Partnerships (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2024 commenced`

-- src:26752 | “company” means a company having a share capital;
-- src:26754 | “foreign company” means a foreign company having a share
-- src:26755 | capital;
@ref s 386ALB(8) (src:26752-26755)
GIVEN `the body has a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALB(8) "company" and "foreign company" the body is one within this section and section 386ALA` MEANS
    IF `the body has a share capital`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“company” means a company having a share capital; “foreign company” means a foreign company having a share capital"

-- src:26757 | “shareholder”, in relation to a company or foreign company,
-- src:26758 | means a person who is registered in the register of members
-- src:26759 | of the company or foreign company as a holder of shares in
-- src:26760 | the company or foreign company.
@ref s 386ALB(8) (src:26757-26760)
GIVEN `the person is registered in the register of members of the company or foreign company as a holder of shares in it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 386ALB(8) "shareholder" the person is a shareholder` MEANS
    IF `the person is registered in the register of members of the company or foreign company as a holder of shares in it`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“shareholder”, in relation to a company or foreign company, means a person who is registered in the register of members ... as a holder of shares"

-- The duties, one for each paragraph that gives a time.
-- src:26591 | (a) who is a nominee on the date of incorporation must inform
-- src:26592 | the company of that fact, and provide to the company
-- src:26593 | prescribed particulars of the person for whom the
-- src:26594 | shareholder is a nominee, within 30 days after the date
-- src:26595 | of incorporation; or
@ref s 386ALB(1)(a) (src:26591-26595)
GIVEN `the shareholder` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALB act`
`s 386ALB(1)(a) a shareholder of a company incorporated on or after 4 October 2022 but before the appointed day who is a nominee on the date of incorporation must inform the company within 30 days after the date of incorporation` MEANS
    PARTY `the shareholder`
    MUST `s 386ALB(1)(a) inform the company that the shareholder is a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the shareholder` BECAUSE "the shareholder did not inform the company within 30 days after the date of incorporation (s 386ALB(1)(a), (6))"
-- src:26597 | (b) who becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation
-- src:26598 | must inform the company of that fact, and provide to the
-- src:26599 | company prescribed particulars of the person for whom the
-- src:26600 | shareholder is a nominee, within 30 days after the date on
-- src:26601 | which the shareholder becomes a nominee.
@ref s 386ALB(1)(b) (src:26597-26601)
GIVEN `the shareholder` IS A Party
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 386ALB act`
`s 386ALB(1)(b) a shareholder of a company incorporated on or after 4 October 2022 but before the appointed day who becomes a nominee after the date of incorporation must inform the company within 30 days after becoming a nominee` MEANS
    PARTY `the shareholder`
    MUST `s 386ALB(1)(b) inform the company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the shareholder` BECAUSE "the shareholder did not inform the company within 30 days after becoming a nominee (s 386ALB(1)(b), (6))"
-- src:26608 | (a) who is a nominee on the date of incorporation must inform
-- src:26609 | the company of that fact, and provide to the company
