DECLARE `s 386ALB act` IS ONE OF
    `s 386ALB(1)(a) inform the company that the shareholder is a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(1)(b) inform the company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(1A)(a) inform the company that the shareholder is a nominee on the date of incorporation and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee on that date`
    `s 386ALB(1A)(b) inform the company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(2)(b) inform the company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(3)(a) inform the foreign company that the shareholder is a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(3)(b) inform the foreign company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(3A)(a) inform the foreign company that the shareholder is a nominee on the date of registration and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee on that date`
    `s 386ALB(3A)(b) inform the foreign company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(4)(b) inform the foreign company that the shareholder has become a nominee and provide the prescribed particulars of the person for whom the shareholder is a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(5)(a) inform the company or foreign company that the shareholder has ceased to be a nominee`
    `s 386ALB(5)(b) inform the company or foreign company of a change to the particulars provided to it`
